>       modality { epistemic underspecified }
>       questions LeaveCircle
>       question "How does an organiser hand a circle to someone else, or close it?"
>       reason "The lending-circles request covers creating, inviting, removing and sharing; it says nothing about organisers stepping down or circles ending."
